   '<b>Maharashtra Political Crisis (2022):</b> the Shiv Sena split raised questions about the distinction between a <b>political party</b> and a <b>legislature party</b>.',
   '<b>Subhash Desai Case (2023):</b> the Supreme Court held that the <b>political party, not merely its legislature party</b>, controls the appointment of the whip.',
